---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AdSlot from '../components/AdSlot.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Terms of Service — TokenFinOps';
const pageDescription = 'Terms of Service and API calculation disclaimers for using the TokenFinOps enterprise cloud cost calculator.';
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} canonicalUrl="/terms">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 border-b border-slate-800 pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">Effective Date: October 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">1. Nature of the Service</h2>
        <p>
          TokenFinOps is a free, publicly accessible technical resource and calculator designed to assist software engineers, FinOps practitioners, and engineering managers in modeling the theoretical cost of artificial intelligence APIs and token architectures.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">2. Calculation Disclaimer and Estimates</h2>
        <p>
          All figures generated by the TokenFinOps mathematical engine represent mathematical estimates based on publicly listed standard list pricing from frontier model providers (including OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Cloud, AWS Bedrock, Microsoft Azure, and DeepSeek). Actual enterprise invoices may vary due to custom volume commitments, negotiated discounts, regional data-center pricing variations, currency conversions, fine-tuning overhead, or unannounced upstream provider price adjustments.
        </p>
        <p>
          TokenFinOps makes no warranty, express or implied, regarding the exact fidelity of future provider billing. Engineering leaders should verify live rates directly with their provider account representatives.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">3. Intellectual Property and Third-Party Trademarks</h2>
        <p>
          All product and service names, logos, and brands mentioned on this website (including OpenAI, GPT-4o, Anthropic, Claude, Gemini, Meta, Llama, Azure, and AWS) are property of their respective trademark owners. Their reference on TokenFinOps is strictly for educational, informational, and comparative identification purposes under fair use doctrine.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          Under no circumstances shall TokenFinOps or its contributors be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from the use of, or inability to use, this calculator, or reliance on any budget estimates generated herein.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">5. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Delaware, United States, without regard to its conflict of law principles.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <AdSlot slotType="footer" />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
